     "type": "compare",
     "head": "Follow-ups on debugging",
     "say": "Follow ups. Can't reproduce it? Add logging, capture the real input. What does bisect need? A good commit and an automatic test. A flaky test? Fix it first, because bisect needs the same verdict each time. Not a commit at all? Check config, data, dependencies. Mistake: changing code before you can reproduce.",
